TO : All concerned BBS/BBC
CC : CTS, CCE, COV, NSS, WSI,
CC : TAOBBO, INCBBO, SHABBO, PUSBR, BI, BTC
FM : CTY - AE

Please be notfied that HNNB0065W/E will be cancelled after HNNB0064E will be phased out at PUS.
- so all R.O.B cargoes to TAO, INC and SHA will be T/S onto the another lanes below at PUS
- and there is no service for O/B through NCI on WK 50 (TAO ETA : Dec 10)
Due to this, all cargoes and concerned cost from parterns are under HJS's account.

Please refer to the T/S guideline for I/B cargoes on HNNB0064E to TAO, INC and SHA.

1. TAO I/B
-  All cargoes including the partner's will be T/S onto KCX/HNAG0024W

2. INC I/B
- All cargoes including the partner's will be T/S onto KPI/HNJE0035E

  However, in these days, KPI lane's space status is very tight, and at that time,
  the T/S cargoes to XGG from TEF will be also diverted to her(HNJE0035E),
  it means that a lot portion of HJS's cargoes will be rolled over to the KPI's next voyages again and again.
  Please minimize the volumes to INC/XGG in December in order to prevent any severe delay and the customer's complaint.

3. SHA I/B
- All cargoes including the partner's will be T/S onto PSX/HNCN0015W

** Attn to all BBS/BBC
   - BKG Update : Please update BKG for T/S shipments after HKG departure in order to check the figures correctly and prevent any confusion,
     but it is recommended to minimize the volumes for any delay and saving cost.

** Attn to TAOBBO, INCBBO, SHABBO
   - As HNNB0064 will be phase out of NCI lane, so only discharging of cargoes will be taken, do not load any O/B cargoes onto HNNB

[cid:44C0.jpg@12345678.87654321]
- FYR, as HNNB will be phased out of NCI, the alternative vessel instead of her isn't decided yet


If having any change or update, will be notified later.
For any questions, please contact CTY - AE. (Do not reply all)


B.rgds

--_000_3DD6E8085D6FFF44B279B195550B27C903555Akovhhvmchanjincom_
